#: source/concepts/schema_fragments.rst:4
msgid "Schema Fragments"
msgstr "模式片段"

#: source/concepts/schema_fragments.rst:6
msgid ""
"Isaac Lab authors physics properties onto USD prims through *schema "
"fragments*: small configuration classes that each mirror exactly one USD "
"applied schema and write into a single attribute namespace. Because "
"fragments compose in lists, one asset configuration can carry OpenUSD "
"physics (``physics:*``), PhysX (``physx*:*``), and Newton (``newton:*`` / "
"``mjc:*``) attributes side by side and run on any backend."
msgstr ""
"Isaac Lab 通过 *模式片段* 将物理属性写入 USD prim。每个片段是一个小型配置类，恰好对应一个 USD "
"应用模式，并写入单一属性命名空间。片段可以在列表中组合，因此一个资产配置能够并列包含 OpenUSD 物理（ ``physics:*`` "
"）、PhysX（ ``physx*:*`` ）和 Newton（ ``newton:*`` / ``mjc:*`` ）属性，并在任意后端运行。"

#: source/concepts/schema_fragments.rst:12
msgid ""
"This page explains the fragment model, the prim-path expressions that target"
" fragments at prims, and the spawner-level configuration surface. For the "
"solver-common vs. backend-specific class tiers, see :ref:`schema-cfgs`. For "
"the full class and function reference, see "
":doc:`/source/api/lab/isaaclab.sim.schemas`."
msgstr ""
"本页介绍片段模型、将片段定位到 prim 的路径表达式，以及生成器层的配置接口。求解器通用类与后端特有类的分层见 :ref:`schema-cfgs` "
"；完整的类和函数参考见 :doc:`/source/api/lab/isaaclab.sim.schemas` 。"

#: source/concepts/schema_fragments.rst:18
msgid "The fragment model"
msgstr "片段模型"

#: source/concepts/schema_fragments.rst:20
msgid ""
"Every fragment subclasses :class:`~isaaclab.sim.schemas.SchemaFragment` and "
"declares which USD namespace its fields write to and which applied schema, "
"if any, it owns. A fragment's "
":attr:`~isaaclab.sim.schemas.SchemaFragment.func` names the callable that "
"applies it to a prim; the default applier "
"(:func:`~isaaclab.sim.schemas.apply_namespaced`) writes each non-``None`` "
"field as ``<namespace>:<camelCase(field)>`` and leaves ``None`` fields "
"untouched (partial update). Irregular APIs override ``func`` — for example "
":class:`~isaaclab.sim.schemas.UsdPhysicsDriveCfg` dispatches through "
":func:`~isaaclab.sim.schemas.apply_drive` to handle the multi-instance "
"``UsdPhysics.DriveAPI``."
msgstr ""
"各片段继承 :class:`~isaaclab.sim.schemas.SchemaFragment` ，声明字段写入的 USD "
"命名空间，以及自己负责的应用模式（如果有）。片段的 :attr:`~isaaclab.sim.schemas.SchemaFragment.func` "
"指定将其应用到 prim 的可调用对象。默认应用函数（ :func:`~isaaclab.sim.schemas.apply_namespaced` "
"）将各非 ``None`` 字段写为 ``<namespace>:<camelCase(field)>`` ，不修改 ``None`` "
"字段（部分更新）。特殊 API 会覆盖 ``func`` ，例如 "
":class:`~isaaclab.sim.schemas.UsdPhysicsDriveCfg` 通过 "
":func:`~isaaclab.sim.schemas.apply_drive` 分发，处理多实例 ``UsdPhysics.DriveAPI`` 。"

#: source/concepts/schema_fragments.rst:31
msgid ""
"Fragments are grouped into *families*, one per spawner slot. Each family has"
" a writer that resolves target prims from an expression and dispatches every"
" fragment via its ``func``. Backend fragments carry backend-specific "
"appliers, so the core package never imports a backend:"
msgstr ""
"片段分为多个 *属性族*，每个生成器槽位对应一个属性族。各族有自己的写入器，根据表达式解析目标 prim，再通过各片段的 ``func`` "
"分发。后端片段携带后端特有的应用函数，因此核心包无需导入后端："

