#: source/concepts/schema_fragments.rst:71
msgid ""
"The tendon families are *tune-not-apply*: the tendon topology is authored in"
" the source asset, so their writers only tune existing instances and never "
"create them. The deformable families sit at the other end of that spectrum: "
"see :ref:`schema-fragments-deformable`. PhysX tendon fragments use "
"``instance_names`` to select one or more instances on each matching prim; "
"``None`` (the default) broadcasts to all existing instances."
msgstr ""
"肌腱属性族遵循 *只调整、不创建* 的原则：肌腱拓扑在源资产中编写，其写入器只调整已有实例，从不创建实例。可变形属性族则相反，参见 "
":ref:`schema-fragments-deformable` 。PhysX 肌腱片段使用 ``instance_names`` 在每个匹配 "
"prim 上选择一个或多个实例； ``None`` （默认值）表示应用到所有已有实例。"

#: source/concepts/schema_fragments.rst:78
msgid ""
"A fixed tendon is split at the same boundary as the PhysX schemas: the root "
"fragment owns whole-tendon dynamics and limits, while the axis fragment owns"
" each joint's contribution. Prim-path matching chooses the joints and "
"``instance_names`` chooses the tendon on those joints:"
msgstr ""
"固定肌腱按 PhysX 模式的边界拆分：根片段负责整个肌腱的动力学和限制，轴片段负责各关节的贡献。prim 路径匹配选择关节， "
"``instance_names`` 选择这些关节上的肌腱："

#: source/concepts/schema_fragments.rst:98
msgid "Targeting expressions"
msgstr "目标表达式"

#: source/concepts/schema_fragments.rst:100
msgid ""
"Target prims are resolved with "
":func:`~isaaclab.sim.utils.queries.find_matching_prims`. The expression is a"
" plain Python regular expression matched against the *whole* prim path. "
"Standard regex semantics apply: ``.`` matches any character including ``/``,"
" so ``/World/Robot/.*`` selects every descendant at any depth, while "
"``[^/]+`` confines a wildcard to a single path segment and "
"``/World/Robot(/.*)?`` selects the prim together with its descendants. The "
"traversal includes inactive and undefined prims as well as instance proxies."
msgstr ""
"目标 prim 通过 :func:`~isaaclab.sim.utils.queries.find_matching_prims` 解析。表达式是普通"
" Python 正则表达式，与 *整个* prim 路径匹配，遵循标准正则语义： ``.`` 匹配任意字符，包括 ``/`` 。因此 "
"``/World/Robot/.*`` 选择任意深度的所有后代， ``[^/]+`` 将通配范围限制为一个路径段， "
"``/World/Robot(/.*)?`` 则选择该 prim 及其后代。遍历包含未激活、未定义的 prim，以及实例代理。"

#: source/concepts/schema_fragments.rst:108
msgid ""
"The matched set is then filtered to valid family targets (see the table "
"above): API carriers for the rigid-body, collision, mass, and articulation "
"families; revolute and prismatic joint prims for the joint-drive family; "
"tendon-bearing prims for the tendon families. Non-joint matches of a joint-"
"drive expression are ignored silently, since a subtree expression "
"legitimately sweeps whole subtrees."
msgstr ""
"随后按属性族的有效目标过滤匹配集合（见上表）：刚体、碰撞、质量和关节体属性族要求目标带有相应 API；关节驱动属性族要求旋转或移动关节 "
"prim；肌腱属性族要求带有肌腱的 prim。关节驱动表达式匹配到的非关节目标会被静默忽略，因为对子树使用表达式时，匹配整棵子树是合理的。"

#: source/concepts/schema_fragments.rst:114
msgid "Edge cases behave as follows:"
msgstr "边界情况如下："

#: source/concepts/schema_fragments.rst:116
msgid ""
"**Instanced matches** cannot be authored on (prototypes are read-only) and "
"are skipped with a warning."
msgstr "**实例化的匹配项** 不可写入（原型为只读），会被跳过并发出警告。"

#: source/concepts/schema_fragments.rst:118
msgid ""
"**Zero targets** emit a warning and the writer returns ``False`` without "
"authoring anything."
msgstr "**没有目标** 时发出警告，写入器不写入任何内容并返回 ``False`` 。"

#: source/concepts/schema_fragments.rst:120
msgid "**An empty fragment list** is an authoring no-op and returns ``True``."
msgstr "**片段列表为空** 时不执行写入，返回 ``True`` 。"

#: source/concepts/schema_fragments.rst:123
msgid "Configuring fragments on spawners"
msgstr "在生成器上配置片段"

#: source/concepts/schema_fragments.rst:125
msgid ""
"Spawner configurations "
"(:class:`~isaaclab.sim.spawners.from_files.UsdFileCfg`, "
":class:`~isaaclab.sim.spawners.shapes.CuboidCfg`, ...) expose one field per "
"family. Each field accepts either a mapping from target pattern to a list of"
" fragments, a bare fragment or list of fragments (see the shorthand below), "
"a single legacy dataclass cfg (e.g. "
":class:`~isaaclab.sim.schemas.RigidBodyBaseCfg` or a backend "
"``*PropertiesCfg``, routed to the legacy writers), or ``None``."
msgstr ""
"生成器配置（ :class:`~isaaclab.sim.spawners.from_files.UsdFileCfg` 、 "
":class:`~isaaclab.sim.spawners.shapes.CuboidCfg` "
"等）为每个属性族提供一个字段。字段接受：目标模式到片段列表的映射；单个片段或片段列表（见下方简写）；单个旧式数据类配置（例如 "
":class:`~isaaclab.sim.schemas.RigidBodyBaseCfg` 或后端的 ``*PropertiesCfg`` "
"，分发到旧式写入器）；或者 ``None`` 。"

#: source/concepts/schema_fragments.rst:133
msgid ""
"Mapping keys are regular-expression suffixes appended to *the prim the "
"spawner authors that family on*: the spawn prim for USD, URDF, and MJCF "
"assets; for shape and mesh spawners, the geometry prim for the collision "
"family and the container prim for the rigid-body and mass families. A key "
"therefore carries its own leading ``/`` when it targets descendants: "
"``\"\"`` selects the anchor prim itself, ``\"/[^/]+\"`` its direct children,"
" and ``\"/.*\"`` everything beneath it. Prefer ``\"/.*\"`` for a whole-"
"subtree rule: the anchor is usually a plain ``Xform`` that carries no family"
" API, so including it changes nothing — except under ``create_if_missing``, "
"where ``\"(/.*)?\"`` would also apply the API to the anchor itself. Reach "
"for ``\"(/.*)?\"`` only when the anchor is genuinely a target too. Entries "
"apply in insertion order, so when two patterns match the same prim, "
"fragments from later entries override attributes authored by earlier ones."
msgstr ""
"映射键是正则表达式后缀，附加在 *生成器写入该属性族的 prim* 之后：USD、URDF 和 MJCF 资产使用生成 "
"prim；形状和网格生成器的碰撞属性族使用几何 prim，刚体和质量属性族使用容器 prim。因此，选择后代时键自身需要带前导 ``/`` ： "
"``\"\"`` 选择锚定 prim 本身， ``\"/[^/]+\"`` 选择直接子节点， ``\"/.*\"`` "
"选择其下方所有节点。整棵子树的规则优先使用 ``\"/.*\"`` ：锚点通常是没有属性族 API 的普通 ``Xform`` "
"，包含它不会改变结果；但启用 ``create_if_missing`` 时， ``\"(/.*)?\"`` 还会将 API "
"应用到锚点本身。只有锚点也确实是目标时才使用 ``\"(/.*)?\"`` 。条目按插入顺序应用；两个模式匹配同一 prim "
"时，后面的片段会覆盖前面写入的属性。"

#: source/concepts/schema_fragments.rst:145
msgid ""
"The bare fragment (or list of fragments) shorthand skips the mapping when a "
"rule needs no targeting of its own. On the shape and mesh spawners it "
"targets the anchor prim, the only prim those spawners author. On the file "
"spawners it targets the spawn prim together with its descendants, so it "
"reaches the schema carriers wherever the asset puts them; and when the "
"subtree carries no prim with the family's defining API at all — the usual "
"shape of an art asset shipped without physics schemas — the file spawners "
"apply that API to the spawn prim and author there, turning the asset into a "
"single body."
msgstr ""
"规则无需单独指定目标时，可直接传入片段或片段列表，省略映射。在形状和网格生成器上，这种简写作用于锚定 prim，也是这些生成器唯一编写的 "
"prim。在文件生成器上，它作用于生成 prim 及其后代，因此无论资产将模式放在哪里，都能找到带模式的 prim。如果整棵子树完全没有带该属性族基础 "
"API 的 prim（不含物理模式的美术资产通常如此），文件生成器会将该 API 应用到生成 prim 并在那里写入，将资产变为单个刚体。"

#: source/concepts/schema_fragments.rst:153
msgid "A robot spawned from USD, with a broad rule and a narrowing override:"
msgstr "从 USD 生成机器人，先应用宽泛规则，再通过更小范围的规则覆盖："

#: source/concepts/schema_fragments.rst:180
msgid ""
"A primitive shape, where every family targets the anchor prim, so the "
"mapping can be dropped entirely:"
msgstr "对于基本形状，各属性族都以锚定 prim 为目标，因此可以完全省略映射："

#: source/concepts/schema_fragments.rst:196
msgid ""
"Reach for the mapping when a rule must target something other than the "
"anchor prim — the usual situation for assets spawned from USD, URDF, or MJCF"
" files, where the spawn prim is a container and the schema carriers sit "
"beneath it."
msgstr ""
"规则需要作用于锚点以外的目标时，使用映射。从 USD、URDF 或 MJCF 文件生成资产时通常如此：生成 prim 是容器，带模式的 prim "
"位于其下方。"

#: source/concepts/schema_fragments.rst:201
msgid "Creating missing APIs"
msgstr "创建缺失的 API"

#: source/concepts/schema_fragments.rst:203
msgid ""
"By default, the family writers only *modify* prims that already carry the "
"family's defining USD API. Three per-family spawner flags — "
"``mass_props_create_if_missing``, ``articulation_props_create_if_missing``, "
"and ``joint_drive_props_create_if_missing`` — additionally apply the "
"defining API to matched prims that lack it before the fragments are authored"
" (for the joint-drive family, the axis-appropriate ``UsdPhysics.DriveAPI`` "
"instance). Shape and mesh spawners always create the APIs on the bare prims "
"they author, since freshly created geometry carries no physics APIs yet."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，属性族写入器只 *修改* 已带有该族基础 USD API 的 prim。生成器提供三个逐属性族开关： "
"``mass_props_create_if_missing`` 、 ``articulation_props_create_if_missing`` "
"和 ``joint_drive_props_create_if_missing`` ，可在写入片段前，为匹配但缺少 API 的 prim 应用基础 "
"API（关节驱动属性族使用适合该轴的 ``UsdPhysics.DriveAPI`` 实例）。形状和网格生成器总会为其编写的原始 prim 创建 "
"API，因为新创建的几何体尚无物理 API。"

#: source/concepts/schema_fragments.rst:211
msgid ""
"The writers trust the expression as written: with creation enabled, every "
"matched prim receives the API, so a too-broad pattern can, for example, give"
" every mesh in a subtree its own mass. Which bodies participate in an "
"articulation is still decided by the asset's joints, not by the expression. "
"Scope creation patterns deliberately."
msgstr ""
"写入器严格按表达式执行：启用创建后，每个匹配 prim 都会得到 "
"API。因此，过宽的模式可能为子树中的每个网格分别设置质量。哪些刚体参与关节体仍由资产的关节决定，而非表达式。请仔细限定创建模式的范围。"

#: source/concepts/schema_fragments.rst:219
msgid "Deformable bodies"
msgstr "可变形物体"

#: source/concepts/schema_fragments.rst:221
msgid ""
"The deformable families invert the \"modify existing\" default: the "
"``volume_deformable_props`` / ``surface_deformable_props`` writers "
"(:func:`~isaaclab.sim.schemas.apply_volume_deformable_properties` / "
":func:`~isaaclab.sim.schemas.apply_surface_deformable_properties`) always "
"create a full deformable-body setup on a matched prim that lacks one, with "
"no opt-in flag to set. Fragments for both slots subclass "
":class:`~isaaclab.sim.schemas.DeformableBodyFragment`; the core-owned "
":class:`~isaaclab.sim.schemas.OmniPhysicsDeformableBodyCfg` carries the "
"solver-common fields (``deformable_body_enabled``, ``kinematic_enabled``, "
"``mass``). PhysX adds its own body-tuning fragments "
"(``PhysxDeformableBodyCfg`` for shared solver/damping attributes, "
"``PhysxSurfaceDeformableBodyCfg`` narrowed to surface deformables) in "
":mod:`isaaclab_physx.sim.schemas`. Newton needs no additional body fragment."
msgstr ""
"可变形属性族与默认的“修改已有对象”行为相反： ``volume_deformable_props`` / "
"``surface_deformable_props`` 写入器（ "
":func:`~isaaclab.sim.schemas.apply_volume_deformable_properties` / "
":func:`~isaaclab.sim.schemas.apply_surface_deformable_properties` "
"）总会为尚无相应配置的匹配 prim 创建完整的可变形物体，无需额外启用开关。两个槽位的片段都继承 "
":class:`~isaaclab.sim.schemas.DeformableBodyFragment` ；核心包中的 "
":class:`~isaaclab.sim.schemas.OmniPhysicsDeformableBodyCfg` 提供求解器通用字段（ "
"``deformable_body_enabled`` 、 ``kinematic_enabled`` 、 ``mass`` ）。PhysX 在 "
":mod:`isaaclab_physx.sim.schemas` 中增加自己的调整片段： ``PhysxDeformableBodyCfg`` "
"提供共享的求解器/阻尼属性， ``PhysxSurfaceDeformableBodyCfg`` 仅用于表面可变形物体。Newton "
"不需要额外的物体片段。"

#: source/concepts/schema_fragments.rst:233
msgid ""
"At most one of the two slots may be set on a spawner: a mesh is spawned as "
"either a volume deformable (tetrahedralized interior) or a surface "
"deformable (cloth-like), never both. The slot's mapping keys are regular-"
"expression suffixes appended to the *spawn* prim — unlike the other "
"families, this holds for every spawner type, including shape and mesh "
"spawners whose other families anchor at the geometry or container prim "
"instead. The empty string ``\"\"`` again selects the spawn prim itself, and "
"``\"(/.*)?\"`` selects it together with its subtree."
msgstr ""
"生成器最多只能设置这两个槽位中的一个：网格要么生成为体积可变形物体（内部四面体划分），要么生成为表面可变形物体（类似布料），不能同时采用两者。槽位的映射键是附加到"
" *生成 prim* 后的正则表达式后缀；与其他属性族不同，这对所有生成器类型都成立，包括其他属性族以几何或容器 prim "
"为锚点的形状和网格生成器。空字符串 ``\"\"`` 同样选择生成 prim 本身， ``\"(/.*)?\"`` 选择它及其子树。"

#: source/concepts/schema_fragments.rst:240
msgid ""
"Creating the deformable setup on a matched prim without the anchor happens "
"in three steps:"
msgstr "对于没有基础模式的匹配 prim，创建可变形物体配置分为三步："

#: source/concepts/schema_fragments.rst:242
msgid ""
"**Simulation mesh.** A ``sim_mesh`` child prim is authored under the target "
"(the name is configurable via the writer's ``sim_mesh_name`` argument). For "
"surface deformables this is a triangle-mesh copy of the visual mesh; for "
"volume deformables it is a tetrahedralized ``UsdGeom.TetMesh`` — reused in "
"place, without re-tetrahedralizing, when the source asset already ships a "
"pre-tetrahedralized ``UsdGeom.TetMesh`` child."
msgstr ""
"**仿真网格。** 在目标下编写 ``sim_mesh`` 子 prim（名称可通过写入器的 ``sim_mesh_name`` "
"参数配置）。表面可变形物体使用可视网格的三角网格副本；体积可变形物体使用经过四面体划分的 ``UsdGeom.TetMesh`` 。源资产已有预先划分的"
" ``UsdGeom.TetMesh`` 子节点时，原地复用，不重复划分。"

#: source/concepts/schema_fragments.rst:247
msgid ""
"**Backend anchor.** The active physics backend applies its own anchor "
"schemas through ``PhysicsManager.setup_deformable_body``: PhysX applies the "
"real ``OmniPhysicsDeformableBodyAPI`` to the body prim (the same single "
"schema for both deformable types) and the type-dependent "
"``OmniPhysicsVolumeDeformableSimAPI`` / "
"``OmniPhysicsSurfaceDeformableSimAPI`` to the simulation-mesh prim, while "
"Newton applies its own (currently token-only) ``Physics*`` schemas. Core "
"fragments own no applied schema of their own — "
":class:`~isaaclab.sim.schemas.OmniPhysicsDeformableBodyCfg` only writes into"
" the ``omniphysics:*`` namespace once the anchor exists."
msgstr ""
"**后端基础模式。** 当前物理后端通过 ``PhysicsManager.setup_deformable_body`` "
"应用自己的基础模式。PhysX 在物体 prim 上应用真正的 ``OmniPhysicsDeformableBodyAPI`` "
"（两种可变形类型使用同一个模式），并在仿真网格 prim 上根据类型应用 ``OmniPhysicsVolumeDeformableSimAPI`` /"
" ``OmniPhysicsSurfaceDeformableSimAPI`` 。Newton 应用自己的 ``Physics*`` 模式（目前仅为 "
"token）。核心片段没有自己的应用模式； "
":class:`~isaaclab.sim.schemas.OmniPhysicsDeformableBodyCfg` 只在基础模式存在后写入 "
"``omniphysics:*`` 命名空间。"

#: source/concepts/schema_fragments.rst:255
msgid ""
"**Fragment dispatch.** Every fragment in the matched slot is applied to the "
"target, in list order, exactly like the other families."
msgstr "**片段分发。** 将匹配槽位中的每个片段按列表顺序应用到目标，与其他属性族完全相同。"

#: source/concepts/schema_fragments.rst:258
msgid ""
"``UsdPhysics.MassAPI`` is not honored for deformables: set mass through "
":attr:`~isaaclab.sim.schemas.OmniPhysicsDeformableBodyCfg.mass` instead."
msgstr ""
"可变形物体不读取 ``UsdPhysics.MassAPI`` ；请通过 "
":attr:`~isaaclab.sim.schemas.OmniPhysicsDeformableBodyCfg.mass` 设置质量。"

#: source/concepts/schema_fragments.rst:261
msgid ""
"Because the simulation mesh already carries ``UsdPhysics.CollisionAPI`` once"
" created, its collision offsets ride the existing collision family rather "
"than a deformable-specific one: key ``collision_props`` to the simulation-"
"mesh child (``\"/sim_mesh\"`` by default), anchored the same way as the "
"deformable slot itself, relative to the spawn prim."
msgstr ""
"仿真网格创建后已带有 ``UsdPhysics.CollisionAPI`` ，因此碰撞偏移使用现有碰撞属性族，而非可变形物体专属属性族：将 "
"``collision_props`` 的键指向仿真网格子节点（默认为 ``\"/sim_mesh\"`` ），与可变形槽位一样，相对于生成 prim "
"定位。"

#: source/concepts/schema_fragments.rst:266
msgid ""
"Physics materials widen the same way: ``physics_material`` accepts "
"deformable material fragments (subclasses of ``DeformableMaterialFragment`` "
"in :mod:`isaaclab.sim.spawners.materials`, e.g. "
"``OmniPhysicsDeformableMaterialCfg`` / "
"``OmniPhysicsSurfaceDeformableMaterialCfg``) and mixed lists that combine a "
"rigid-body material fragment with a deformable one. The "
"``UsdPhysics.MaterialAPI`` anchor is applied only when the list contains a "
"rigid-body material fragment; deformable material fragments apply their own "
"schema (e.g. ``OmniPhysicsDeformableMaterialAPI``) independently, since a "
"material prim bound only to deformable bodies has no rigid-body material "
"semantics to anchor."
msgstr ""
"物理材质也采用同样的扩展方式： ``physics_material`` 接受可变形材质片段（ "
":mod:`isaaclab.sim.spawners.materials` 中 ``DeformableMaterialFragment`` "
"的子类，例如 ``OmniPhysicsDeformableMaterialCfg`` / "
"``OmniPhysicsSurfaceDeformableMaterialCfg`` "
"），也接受将刚体材质片段与可变形片段组合的混合列表。只有列表包含刚体材质片段时，才应用 ``UsdPhysics.MaterialAPI`` "
"基础模式；可变形材质片段独立应用自身模式（例如 ``OmniPhysicsDeformableMaterialAPI`` "
"），因为仅绑定到可变形物体的材质 prim 不具有需要该基础模式的刚体材质语义。"

